   <Placemark>
    <name>Gull Rd SUP – east segment (added Oct 2026)</name>
    <description>&lt;b&gt;Status (as of Oct 14, 2026):&lt;/b&gt; Existing – listed as a shared-use path in KATS's facilities layer; not new, but it was missing from the club map.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Facility:&lt;/b&gt; Shared-use path along Gull Rd (M-43)&lt;br&gt;Fills the gap between the club map's Gull Rd paths. Drawn on the Gull Rd centerline; which side of the road the path is on isn't recorded.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Sources:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://services8.arcgis.com/iMB25Rg6ZW5ZL5YH/arcgis/rest/services/Existing_Facilities_October_2026/FeatureServer/0"&gt;KATS Existing Facilities October 2026 (ArcGIS layer, edited Oct 7, 2026)&lt;/a&gt;</description>
