   <Placemark>
    <name>Kal-Haven Trail – Bloomingdale to South Haven</name>
    <description>&lt;b&gt;Status (as of Oct 15, 2026):&lt;/b&gt; Open.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Facility:&lt;/b&gt; Rail-trail, crushed limestone, 12 ft+ (Kal-Haven Trail State Park)&lt;br&gt;Continues the club map's Kal-Haven line west to the South Haven trailhead. The South Haven–Bloomingdale section was resurfaced and its bridges rebuilt in 2023–24 (reopened June 2024).&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Sources:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://gisagoegle.state.mi.us/arcgis/rest/services/DNR/DNRTrailsOPENDATA/MapServer/16"&gt;Michigan DNR statewide rail-trails&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/MIDNR/bulletins/39e857d"&gt;Michigan DNR – Kal-Haven Trail State Park fully open (June 2024)&lt;/a&gt;</description>
