   <name>Coming: Shared Use Pathways (planned / under construction)</name>
   <Placemark>
    <name>Austin Lake Trail (Portage) – Zylman Ave to Nash Ave, under construction, opens 2027</name>
    <description>&lt;b&gt;Status (as of Oct 14, 2026):&lt;/b&gt; Under construction. Final land acquired Sept 2025; tree removal winter 2025–26; completion expected 2027.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Facility:&lt;/b&gt; New 10-ft asphalt trail with 2-ft shoulders, ~1.8 mi (Portage project 2024005.01)&lt;br&gt;Starts at the Zylman Ave / Coxs Dr roundabout sidewalk, follows Coxs Dr and East Shore Dr, then the old rail bed along the east side of Austin Lake to Nash Ave. Route traced from the city's Austin Lake Trail property control map (May 2024).&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Sources:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://wkzo.com/2025/09/12/833228/"&gt;WKZO – Portage acquires final land for Austin Lake Trail (Sept 12, 2025)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://stories.opengov.com/portagemi/published/gqWUrtCEvJ"&gt;City of Portage 2024–2030 CIP – Bikeways &amp;amp; Trailways&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.portagemi.gov/644/Park-Projects"&gt;City of Portage / Viridis – Austin Lake Trail Property Control Map (May 28, 2024)&lt;/a&gt;</description>
    <styleUrl>#upd2026-csup</styleUrl>
    <LineString>
     <tessellate>1</tessellate>
     <coordinates>-85.55047,42.19338,0 -85.55053,42.19313,0 -85.55052,42.19158,0 -85.55049,42.19147,0 -85.55036,42.19138,0 -85.54859,42.19098,0 -85.54753,42.19067,0 -85.54622,42.19021,0 -85.54552,42.18990,0 -85.54536,42.18995,0 -85.54537,42.19039,0 -85.54526,42.19048,0 -85.54514,42.19041,0 -85.53994,42.18010,0 -85.53971,42.17963,0 -85.53965,42.17926,0 -85.53940,42.17899,0 -85.53805,42.17636,0 -85.53755,42.17526,0 -85.53687,42.17344,0 -85.53657,42.17238,0 -85.53653,42.17194,0</coordinates>
    </LineString>
   </Placemark>
   <Placemark>
    <name>Austin Lake Trail (Portage) – Nash Ave to Vicksburg Trail, under construction, opens 2027</name>
    <description>&lt;b&gt;Status (as of Oct 14, 2026):&lt;/b&gt; Under construction. Final land acquired Sept 2025; tree removal winter 2025–26; completion expected 2027.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Facility:&lt;/b&gt; New 10-ft asphalt trail with 2-ft shoulders, ~1.1 mi, including a boardwalk through the wetland (Portage project 2024005.02)&lt;br&gt;Follows the old rail bed south from Nash Ave to Portage's south city limit, where it connects to the existing Vicksburg Trail. Route traced from the city's Austin Lake Trail property control map (May 2024).&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Sources:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://wkzo.com/2025/09/12/833228/"&gt;WKZO – Portage acquires final land for Austin Lake Trail (Sept 12, 2025)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://stories.opengov.com/portagemi/published/gqWUrtCEvJ"&gt;City of Portage 2024–2030 CIP – Bikeways &amp;amp; Trailways&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.portagemi.gov/644/Park-Projects"&gt;City of Portage / Viridis – Austin Lake Trail Property Control Map (May 28, 2024)&lt;/a&gt;</description>
